Scope of this license

The MIT terms above cover only the material authored in this repository: the
documentation (README.md), the screenshots under Resources/ and macOS/, and the
OpenCore configuration files under EFI/OC/config/.

They do NOT cover the third-party components redistributed here, each of which
remains under its own upstream license:

  * OpenCore (EFI/BOOT/BOOTx64.efi, EFI/OC/OpenCore.efi, EFI/OC/Drivers/,
    EFI/OC/Tools/, EFI/OC/Resources/) and the Acidanthera kexts
    (Lilu, VirtualSMC and its SMC* plugins, WhateverGreen, AppleALC, ECEnabler)
    - Acidanthera, BSD-3-Clause.
  * VoodooPS2Controller - Acidanthera / RehabMan, derived from Apple's
    ApplePS2Controller; see the upstream project for its terms.
  * USBInjectAll, XHCI-unsupported, XLNCUSBFix, telemetrap,
    AMDRyzenCPUPowerManagement, SMCAMDProcessor, AppleMCEReporterDisabler
    - see each upstream project for its terms.
  * The AMD kernel patches in the AMD configs originate from AMD_Vanilla
    (AMD-OSX).

This repository does not grant any right to macOS itself. macOS is a product of
Apple Inc. and is governed by Apple's Software License Agreement.
